  =========

  Common Compressors

| Compressor            | Purpose                                                           |
| --------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **LLMChainExtractor** | Extracts only the relevant sentences from documents using an LLM. |
| **LLMChainFilter**    | Filters out irrelevant documents before they reach the LLM.       |
| **EmbeddingsFilter**  | Removes documents with low semantic similarity using embeddings.  |

